# interplay_versions_suspend_lowered: Children 1, 31, 40 and 63 defined at 245 (maxFIFOCount 64), each with a NOP; the guest then lowers the version to 60 (32 FIFOs) and migrates. The blob carries 60, and the fresh device rebuilds only the children below its maxFIFOCount (rvg_device_did_resume walks ids 1 to maxFIFOCount - 1): 1 and 31 run on, while 40 and 63, whose nodes still say running, are not FIFOs there (a doorbell on them does nothing). Raised to 245 again, the guest defines 40 and 63 anew (their nodes as it left them: a define over a running node is a new FIFO) and each runs a NOP.
